message: If you use fumadocs-feynman in published work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "fumadocs-feynman: Feynman diagrams for fumadocs"
abstract: >-
  Feynman diagrams for fumadocs documentation sites, written in feynman code blocks and rendered to static,
  theme-aware SVG at build time, with templates for the standard diagrams of many-body perturbation theory.
